        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68ad29ea000000001c01160c:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-5:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "然后一道手撕代码题，由于自己之前做过，所以一看到题目就知道怎么做，然后很快就把代码写出来了。之后面试官让我写一个样例跑一下，一跑一个准，直接秒了hhh",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68ad29ea000000001c01160c.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "5ef2c9a4466e4386b25b440b97d466cbcd7c73b5eff4c4ad8253ebb47fc1bb63",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68ad29ea000000001c01160c.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "b6f1aa7c8a3aefb339cbbd987c2fe2f85fa47cdaa63e192bf93051728ce0d3dc",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68ad29ea000000001c01160c:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-5:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "由于我使用的语言是 C++，但是推荐算法一般都是 Python，所以面试官又让我用 Python 对数组进行排序，使用什么排序方法都可以。其实我早就开始用 Python 刷题了，所以很快就写出来了[害羞R]，这点如果还没有留意的uu要注意咯。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68ad29ea000000001c01160c.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "5ef2c9a4466e4386b25b440b97d466cbcd7c73b5eff4c4ad8253ebb47fc1bb63",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68ad29ea000000001c01160c.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "b6f1aa7c8a3aefb339cbbd987c2fe2f85fa47cdaa63e192bf93051728ce0d3dc",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68ad29ea000000001c01160c:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-5:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "整体来说感觉很好，没有什么很致命的失误[鼓掌R]，唯一需要改进的可能是有时候表达再清晰一些。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68ad29ea000000001c01160c.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "5ef2c9a4466e4386b25b440b97d466cbcd7c73b5eff4c4ad8253ebb47fc1bb63",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68ad29ea000000001c01160c.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "b6f1aa7c8a3aefb339cbbd987c2fe2f85fa47cdaa63e192bf93051728ce0d3dc",
        "source_projection_item_number": 4
